"The volume of two cubes are in a certain ratio, and the ratio of their edges is 3:1. If the volume of the first cube is 27 units, what is the volume of the second cube?","<bos><start_of_turn>user
The volume of two cubes are in a certain ratio, and the ratio of their edges is 3:1. If the volume of the first cube is 27 units, what is the volume of the second cube?<end_of_turn>
