\[
P_3(x) = \frac{3!}{3!} \sum_{k=0}^{3} (-1)^k \binom{3}{k} \left(\frac{x}{2}\right)^{2k}
\]
Expanding the sum:
\[
P_3(x) = 1 \left[ \left(\frac{x}{2}\right^{2 \cdot 0} - \binom{3}{1} \left(\frac{x}{2}\right)^{2 \cdot 1} + \binom{3}{2} \left(\frac{x}{2}\right)^{2 \cdot 2} - \binom{3}{3} \left(\frac{x}{2}\right)^{2 \cdot 3} \right]
