   \[
   y(t) = e^{h(t) t} \left( \int g(t) e^{-h(t) t} \, dt + C \right)
   \]
   Thus, the general solution is:
   \[
   y(t) = e^{h(t) t} \int g(t) e^{-h(t) t} \, dt + C e^{h(t) t}
   \]

